flowchart TB
  project[Project 与 Repository 身份] --> local[Local Session<br/>共享原 checkout]
  project --> worktree[Managed Worktree Session<br/>受管独立 checkout]
  projectless[Projectless Session] --> private[独立私有 Workspace]
  local --> binding[Session Workspace Binding]
  worktree --> binding
  private --> binding
  binding --> tools[工具权限与身份版本核验]
  binding --> checkpoint[Checkpoint<br/>持久 lineage 与文件恢复资料]
  checkpoint --> rewind[Rewind<br/>校验前提后恢复指定范围]
  checkpoint --> fork[Fork<br/>冻结历史并创建新 Session]
  local --> handoff[Local / Worktree Handoff]
  handoff --> worktree
  worktree --> archive[归档、快照与恢复]
  fork --> binding
